# Walkthrough: Depth Tracker Tier 1 MVP

> **Date:** 2026-01-05  
> **Status:** ✅ Implementation Complete  
> **Testing:** Pending (requires Python 3.10+ environment)

---

## What Was Built

The **Depth Tracker** is an ADHD accommodation feature that tracks your position in the conversation tree. It warns (but doesn't block) when you're going deep into rabbit holes.

### Core Philosophy

```
WARN but ALLOW - it's a guardrail, not a wall
```

