**Added CLI Commands:**

```bash
nucleus depth show      # Show current depth indicator
nucleus depth up        # Come back up one level
nucleus depth reset     # Reset to root level  
nucleus depth max N     # Set max safe depth
nucleus depth push X    # Go deeper into topic X
```

