2. Ask: "Let's dive into implementing auth"
   - Should call [brain_depth_push("implementing auth")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2224-2238) and return depth 1

3. Ask: "What about JWT tokens?"
   - Should call [brain_depth_push("JWT tokens")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2224-2238) and return depth 2

4. Keep going deeper until you see warnings at level 3, 4, 5

5. Say: "Let's go back to the main topic"
   - Should call [brain_depth_pop()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2239-2250) or [brain_depth_reset()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2265-2276)

