### 3. Render Poller (Tier 1 MVP)

**Goal**: Monitor deployments and verify health without leaving the chat.

**Implementation**:
- **Core Logic**: Added [_start_deploy_poll](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#966-1014), [_check_deploy_status](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#1015-1060), [_complete_deploy](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#1061-1117), [_run_smoke_test](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#910-954).
- **MCP Tools**: [brain_start_deploy_poll](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2310-2325), [brain_check_deploy](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2326-2341), [brain_complete_deploy](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2342-2361), [brain_smoke_test](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2362-2376).
- **Integration**: Logs events to ledger (`deploy_poll_started`, `deploy_complete`) and tracks active polls in `active_polls.json`.

**Verification**:
- **Smoke Test**: Verified against live GentleQuest production (`https://gentlequest.onrender.com`).
  - Result: `PASSED`, Status: `healthy`, Latency: ~567ms.
- **Workflow**: Confirmed end-to-end flow with local script:
  1. [brain_start_deploy_poll](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2310-2325) -> Logs start event.
  2. [brain_check_deploy](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2326-2341) -> Reports elapsed time.
  3. [brain_complete_deploy](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2342-2361) -> Runs smoke test and logs completion.

**Next Steps**:
- Verify upstream Render MCP stability (currently flaky).
- Use [brain_smoke_test](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2362-2376) as the primary health check.

