## Bonus: Exploration Map (Tier 2b Preview)

### What It Does

Generates a **Mermaid diagram** of your current exploration path - like a Strategy Game map!

### How to Use

In Claude Desktop:
```
"Show me my exploration map"
```

Claude will call `brain_depth_map()` and return something like:

```mermaid
graph TD
    ROOT((🏠 START))
    ROOT --> L0["🟢 News"]
    style L0 fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#0a0
    L0 --> L1["🟢 Venezuela"]
    style L1 fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#0a0
    L1 --> L2["🟡 Petroleum"]
    style L2 fill:#ffffcc,stroke:#cc0
    L2 --> L3["🔴 Heavy Crude"]
    style L3 fill:#ffddcc,stroke:#f60
    L3 --> L4[["🔴 Sanctions"]]
    style L4 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#f00
    style L4 stroke-width:3px
```

### CLI Command

```bash
nucleus depth map
```

